sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Integration probe
    participant O as Orders API and Saga
    participant D as Orders database
    participant H as History
    T->>O: Accept one synthetic checkout
    T->>D: Arm UUID-scoped confirmation outbox exception
    O->>D: Update order and sequence, insert OrderConfirmed
    D-->>O: Exception rolls transaction back
    O->>D: Record retry in separate transaction
    T->>D: Assert PENDING_PAYMENT, accepted event only, sequence 1
    T->>H: Assert accepted state/sequence after zero lag
    T->>D: Finally remove trigger and function
    O->>D: Retry commits confirmation and later fulfillment
    T->>O: Assert terminal order, single capture, one-unit stock use
    T->>H: Assert terminal projection and contiguous sequences
